# Naming

```txt
UserCard.tsx
use-auth.ts
auth.service.ts
get-user.usecase.ts
users.query.ts
auth.context.tsx
format-date.ts
```

- Use lowercase with hyphens for file names
- Use PascalCase for components/types
- Use camelCase for variables/functions
